  "name": "Manual Experience Multiplier for Each Skills (M.E.M.E.S)",
  "slug": "manual-experience-multiplier-for-each-skills-memes",
  "teaser": "Allows you to change the experience multiplier for each skill separately + disable \"skill fatigue\" functionality",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1953.png",
  "downloads": 5793,
  "favourites_count": 0,
  "description": "<p>The title speaks for itself</p>\n<p>This small mod does 2 things:</p>\n<p>- Removes the “skill fatigue” functionality, so the amount of experience is always constant</p>\n<p>- Allows you to change the experience multiplier for each skill separately in BepInEx menu</p>\n<p><strong>Installation</strong></p>\n<p>1. Drag&amp;Drop this file into BepInEx/plugins</p>\n<p>2. Press F12 to Open BepInEx menu and find <strong>Manual Experience Multiplier</strong></p>\n<p>3. Then change the multiplier for each skill as you like (applies instantly, even if you’re in a raid)</p>\n",
